      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9ae171845821d7cb76951628_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The text will be extracted from the following file formats:",
      "sourceHash": "9ae171845821d7cb76951628ce3f99bd5cc2d29294ebef6e95f3a0ce7e4ae0a7",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Supported formats > Office documents",
      "contextHash": "502ca2c4719a33900186c122e21ebc07944c110ca228ebc8db498c0891a2a6f7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8feaf128338e37359ad53836_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Microsoft Word documents",
      "sourceHash": "8feaf128338e37359ad538361f070b3c7113bacbcc6c276e25374cc705e4e41e",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Supported formats > Office documents",
      "contextHash": "502ca2c4719a33900186c122e21ebc07944c110ca228ebc8db498c0891a2a6f7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bf7d7a5bb3fb8f58f8513d49_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Microsoft Excel documents",
      "sourceHash": "bf7d7a5bb3fb8f58f8513d4924315a68b71d6dc86be059c51a57d9d86ac5e34f",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Supported formats > Office documents",
      "contextHash": "502ca2c4719a33900186c122e21ebc07944c110ca228ebc8db498c0891a2a6f7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_be2ecb701b5f462baa8bdfd0_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Only the raw text information, the cell structure is not maintained.",
      "sourceHash": "be2ecb701b5f462baa8bdfd0a47352162798259d33ab4bfa7628e9a64ef367c9",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Supported formats > Office documents",
      "contextHash": "502ca2c4719a33900186c122e21ebc07944c110ca228ebc8db498c0891a2a6f7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_83ecdccaf7738c0b23c63daa_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Values are extracted raw, so searching for dates will not work. The OpenDocument alternative will actually extract the properly formatted value.",
      "sourceHash": "83ecdccaf7738c0b23c63daa965bbefccc57af0730e54f7d1363f5e979526047",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Supported formats > Office documents",
      "contextHash": "502ca2c4719a33900186c122e21ebc07944c110ca228ebc8db498c0891a2a6f7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2cab2f214d95bf966cd39a9e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Microsoft PowerPoint documents",
      "sourceHash": "2cab2f214d95bf966cd39a9eb814aa8d207a5b48f67cbbbb1c7c1fd6325586de",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Supported formats > Office documents",
      "contextHash": "502ca2c4719a33900186c122e21ebc07944c110ca228ebc8db498c0891a2a6f7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6724dfd745456526b30eae5d_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The OpenDocument alternatives to the previous formats (Text, Spreadsheet, Presentation), created by editors such as LibreOffice and OpenOffice.",
      "sourceHash": "6724dfd745456526b30eae5d8a4f3345a46fa380050118570cab198dbbc40daf",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Supported formats > Office documents",
      "contextHash": "502ca2c4719a33900186c122e21ebc07944c110ca228ebc8db498c0891a2a6f7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_901c4958d34be4adf142e72f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Rich Text Format (RTF)__TRILIUM_PH_1__, since v0.104.0.",
      "sourceHash": "901c4958d34be4adf142e72f98b24617e48eb051ffb9e61bacf67fe58ceb5c25",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Supported formats > Office documents",
      "contextHash": "502ca2c4719a33900186c122e21ebc07944c110ca228ebc8db498c0891a2a6f7",
