    {
      "id": "u_7b429c0d4ddb2cb0db33e278_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Configuring and triggering OCR__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "7b429c0d4ddb2cb0db33e278c0f6ee28a59f86240f66d4bacc064ca469a44b05",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Configuring and triggering OCR",
      "contextHash": "5659cbc8ca6aec6ec2b94f9112287a99568a11a32727ffa389472f5f9846851d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_adebd305ed88c35338fc9ec7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The OCR can be configured by going to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Options__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Media__TRILIUM_PH_3__ and looking for the __TRILIUM_PH_4__Text Extraction (OCR)__TRILIUM_PH_5__ section.",
      "sourceHash": "adebd305ed88c35338fc9ec7d4e5b4dd770cdb5b4feac3f0be59098fcc730039",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Configuring and triggering OCR",
      "contextHash": "5659cbc8ca6aec6ec2b94f9112287a99568a11a32727ffa389472f5f9846851d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_409027d71049477ee90dd921_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "There are three ways to trigger the OCR:",
      "sourceHash": "409027d71049477ee90dd921026cdb3f9e955ce487a6f79257418aed4ac81932",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Configuring and triggering OCR",
      "contextHash": "5659cbc8ca6aec6ec2b94f9112287a99568a11a32727ffa389472f5f9846851d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_09958f42731569c385a81067_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "By enabling __TRILIUM_PH_0__Auto-process new files__TRILIUM_PH_1__ which will process only the notes or attachments created after enabling the option, existing files will remain unprocessed.",
      "sourceHash": "09958f42731569c385a81067edbd118f50432385e9c5a26874932befeeb21d60",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Configuring and triggering OCR",
      "contextHash": "5659cbc8ca6aec6ec2b94f9112287a99568a11a32727ffa389472f5f9846851d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c6d6493517b5035c46f0e063_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "By pressing __TRILIUM_PH_0__Start Batch Processing__TRILIUM_PH_1__ which will process all the existing notes.",
      "sourceHash": "c6d6493517b5035c46f0e06353b90926dfb7a4300c7d8b62052e3ebd10b2be32",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Configuring and triggering OCR",
      "contextHash": "5659cbc8ca6aec6ec2b94f9112287a99568a11a32727ffa389472f5f9846851d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ddbfdc5c8e49746f32ee1a70_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "By manually requesting for an image or file to have its text extracted, regardless of whether the automatic processing is enabled or not.",
      "sourceHash": "ddbfdc5c8e49746f32ee1a707ce8f18de2cbaf27be6c9a42659871c0f057e229",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Configuring and triggering OCR",
      "contextHash": "5659cbc8ca6aec6ec2b94f9112287a99568a11a32727ffa389472f5f9846851d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cebef3556047c0573c9b5578_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Minimum confidence__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "cebef3556047c0573c9b5578e58c950bfde2cd7b3bd72836ac8d8db3d5c7eace",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Configuring and triggering OCR > Minimum confidence",
      "contextHash": "3d7baf2c546610cc346f36b74c5844e00c1796a1b199619789e7bbb148fd2899",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_65d0b980085cdfa7f1d3ab10_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When extracting text from an image, there is a certain level of confidence which indicates whether the extracted text appears relevant.",
      "sourceHash": "65d0b980085cdfa7f1d3ab108256d7d682d1a5412b5c0d8888618a4931eb5bec",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Configuring and triggering OCR > Minimum confidence",
      "contextHash": "3d7baf2c546610cc346f36b74c5844e00c1796a1b199619789e7bbb148fd2899",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5656d8258d9fbaf233b05619_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When the minimum confidence is set to a low percentage, the text extraction can interpret symbols and drawings incorrectly resulting in garbled text.",
      "sourceHash": "5656d8258d9fbaf233b05619857f3de693255d2d3cf29117360329b94eb303b7",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Configuring and triggering OCR > Minimum confidence",
      "contextHash": "3d7baf2c546610cc346f36b74c5844e00c1796a1b199619789e7bbb148fd2899",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_56aef5f289abaeb311ddb7e8_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If the extracted text for a note or an attachment quality is lower than the minimum confidence, the OCR is disregarded.",
      "sourceHash": "56aef5f289abaeb311ddb7e8e5d918a9a409d05fafd3812ee285145bc48cc327",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Configuring and triggering OCR > Minimum confidence",
      "contextHash": "3d7baf2c546610cc346f36b74c5844e00c1796a1b199619789e7bbb148fd2899",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_39bd66f81a996269d20ff77c_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Language management__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "39bd66f81a996269d20ff77c3c176cba63d20e75c2ef64df7e722fd4571f7f5c",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Language management",
      "contextHash": "76f5f2d444c2b824e3864a8fdaa58d72e8d2fbf3699a69d54e7897e98b8fa4a7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_33d8d68ea26cccf1cb0e20e4_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "OCR needs to be aware of the language of the content in order for it to work correctly. The reason is that each language has its own data which needs to be downloaded, and accents or other symbols will not be supported by the default language.",
      "sourceHash": "33d8d68ea26cccf1cb0e20e4fc10da9b330f6cda64c3050acbced65efaa5afc1",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Language management",
      "contextHash": "76f5f2d444c2b824e3864a8fdaa58d72e8d2fbf3699a69d54e7897e98b8fa4a7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9595c63db4d907ccbf5bef57_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To configure the languages that are supported by the OCR, simply go to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Options__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Language & Region__TRILIUM_PH_3__ and adjust the __TRILIUM_PH_4__Content languages__TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "9595c63db4d907ccbf5bef5790bb44067c5482df541d09a5cb830a46edc035dd",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Language management",
      "contextHash": "76f5f2d444c2b824e3864a8fdaa58d72e8d2fbf3699a69d54e7897e98b8fa4a7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_52b9795d5646ff922e91e8f5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When there are no content languages defined, the user interface __TRILIUM_PH_0__Language__TRILIUM_PH_1__ is used instead.",
      "sourceHash": "52b9795d5646ff922e91e8f58943ca4ecce63ae26e74f4ca7b0f871702993e05",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Language management",
      "contextHash": "76f5f2d444c2b824e3864a8fdaa58d72e8d2fbf3699a69d54e7897e98b8fa4a7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5d0e1dae41dd0c974b8c57fe_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "After making this change, the automatic processing or manual reprocessing will take into consideration the new languages.",
      "sourceHash": "5d0e1dae41dd0c974b8c57fec7da4a0ceac9e429d12e5ee2b4d9020b4b93eb0d",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Language management",
      "contextHash": "76f5f2d444c2b824e3864a8fdaa58d72e8d2fbf3699a69d54e7897e98b8fa4a7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e0406edcc52c740902545537_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To enforce the detection in a particular language for a given note, use the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ __TRILIUM_PH_1__attribute__TRILIUM_PH_2__, similar to __TRILIUM_PH_3__text content language__TRILIUM_PH_4__. For __TRILIUM_PH_5__Attachments__TRILIUM_PH_6__, it's not possible to manually adjust the language.",
      "sourceHash": "e0406edcc52c7409025455376f11c4c5f01b9caee53619d52f039a82c27af3ae",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Language management",
      "contextHash": "76f5f2d444c2b824e3864a8fdaa58d72e8d2fbf3699a69d54e7897e98b8fa4a7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3c0dbe31b817955c48f555bb_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The trained data for each language is not packaged with Trilium, as that would require a significant amount of space that might not be otherwise needed. As such, when the trained data will be downloaded automatically via __TRILIUM_PH_0__Tesseract.js__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "3c0dbe31b817955c48f555bb037449759751813547f0292e8c23a7b68eac1d71",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Language management",
      "contextHash": "76f5f2d444c2b824e3864a8fdaa58d72e8d2fbf3699a69d54e7897e98b8fa4a7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c16dfd00d12b2c32c61a05d7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The downloaded trained data is located in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Data directory__TRILIUM_PH_1__, in the __TRILIUM_PH_2__ directory.",
      "sourceHash": "c16dfd00d12b2c32c61a05d75d9b0cb4f6fd718209287db3408c91b8a47ff85a",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Language management",
      "contextHash": "76f5f2d444c2b824e3864a8fdaa58d72e8d2fbf3699a69d54e7897e98b8fa4a7",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_eba7ab9781e172d45cf8c611_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Viewing extracted content for a single note__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "eba7ab9781e172d45cf8c611446946b8853af07864e9a9ed97767d695c05aafa",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Viewing extracted content for a single note",
      "contextHash": "c9fb8ed67d69f581e46bc5dc7648c587f5c9faf2b28412612faf85eaf573a265",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3caed1640d7b3abfa1e3ff94_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To access the extracted content of a note:",
      "sourceHash": "3caed1640d7b3abfa1e3ff945c2a4216addfa17f2c6e30592b55da17a94a1b46",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Viewing extracted content for a single note",
      "contextHash": "c9fb8ed67d69f581e46bc5dc7648c587f5c9faf2b28412612faf85eaf573a265",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_955455efeced48c0d6d16067_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For __TRILIUM_PH_0__File__TRILIUM_PH_1__ notes, go to the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Note menu__TRILIUM_PH_3__ → __TRILIUM_PH_4__Advanced__TRILIUM_PH_5__ → __TRILIUM_PH_6__View OCR Text__TRILIUM_PH_7__.",
      "sourceHash": "955455efeced48c0d6d160677b9930a697d9f38df27213e71c1995311a17b1d4",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Viewing extracted content for a single note",
      "contextHash": "c9fb8ed67d69f581e46bc5dc7648c587f5c9faf2b28412612faf85eaf573a265",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8ff816512273a3aa596ea35c_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For __TRILIUM_PH_0__Attachments__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (e.g. __TRILIUM_PH_2__Images__TRILIUM_PH_3__ in __TRILIUM_PH_4__Text__TRILIUM_PH_5__ notes), double-click the attachment to view the details, press the […] button at the left and select __TRILIUM_PH_6__View extracted text (OCR)__TRILIUM_PH_7__.",
      "sourceHash": "8ff816512273a3aa596ea35c9d35127d6655b7c92ecadda110e4dbb915a38b0b",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Viewing extracted content for a single note",
      "contextHash": "c9fb8ed67d69f581e46bc5dc7648c587f5c9faf2b28412612faf85eaf573a265",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bf81af99e83e5c0be6ee44eb_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This section allows:",
      "sourceHash": "bf81af99e83e5c0be6ee44eb24a9ee1820fe1fefdbeca431eacb48e46dc6b196",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Viewing extracted content for a single note",
      "contextHash": "c9fb8ed67d69f581e46bc5dc7648c587f5c9faf2b28412612faf85eaf573a265",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1b9b961e38bddbf19fa2aa76_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Viewing the extracted text, which can be copied elsewhere if needed or just to check the quality of the extraction.",
      "sourceHash": "1b9b961e38bddbf19fa2aa760ca721b94051be5d7d149ffea287f1d75a70acaa",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Viewing extracted content for a single note",
      "contextHash": "c9fb8ed67d69f581e46bc5dc7648c587f5c9faf2b28412612faf85eaf573a265",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d36930cb8cab72fce98d90d6_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If the note has not been extracted yet, pressing __TRILIUM_PH_0__Process OCR__TRILIUM_PH_1__ will process it in the background. If the extraction confidence is lower than the minimum confidence, there will be a notification.",
      "sourceHash": "d36930cb8cab72fce98d90d65ece31ec5f9a3c79ddd9797e779eba1ac88c9b9d",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Viewing extracted content for a single note",
      "contextHash": "c9fb8ed67d69f581e46bc5dc7648c587f5c9faf2b28412612faf85eaf573a265",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b8e1917f315bd3f76c33e8bf_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Similarly, if the minimum confidence was changed in settings, it is possible to press the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Process OCR__TRILIUM_PH_1__ button again to extract the text again.",
      "sourceHash": "b8e1917f315bd3f76c33e8bf70989b2275d74752f92c3c8a85145ea5f09497e2",
      "context": "Text Extraction (OCR) > Viewing extracted content for a single note",
      "contextHash": "c9fb8ed67d69f581e46bc5dc7648c587f5c9faf2b28412612faf85eaf573a265",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    }
  ],
  "requests": []
}
